This repository contains Kubernetes manifests, kpt package metadata
(Kptfile, setters.yaml), documentation and helper scripts. It does not
contain container images or binaries; the images listed below are pulled
from their registries at deployment time and keep their own licenses.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material included in this repository
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

1. towards5gs-helm (free5GC Helm charts)
   https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/towards5gs-helm
   License: Apache License 2.0
   The free5GC network-function manifests in free5gc-5gcore-others/ and
   free5gc-amf-smf-upf/ were rendered from these Helm charts and then
   modified (namespaces, storage, setters, node placement).

2. free5GC
   https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc
   License: Apache License 2.0
   The ConfigMaps of the free5GC network functions contain free5GC
   configuration files (amfcfg.yaml, smfcfg.yaml, nrfcfg.yaml, ...).

3. Bitnami MongoDB Helm chart (chart mongodb-15.6.0)
   https://github.com/bitnami/charts
   License: Apache License 2.0
   free5gc-5gcore-others/resources/10-mongodb.yaml was rendered from it.

